WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.925
Fill the corner to make a square, then take away what you didn't have.

2
00:00:04.852 --> 00:00:09.127
Nine ones fill the corner: a perfect square, x plus three, squared.

3
00:00:10.103 --> 00:00:13.603
Take four ones away: five are left, so four are missing.
